msgid "More themes to set a CV or a portfolio in, beside Postulo's own: one a hiring system reads cleanly and one laid out as the Europass CV is. Switched off, the themes are no longer offered, and a document set in one of them is drawn in the plain theme until it is switched on again."
msgstr "Tuilleadh téamaí chun CV nó punann a leagan amach, taobh le téamaí Postulo féin: ceann a léann córas earcaíochta go glan agus ceann atá leagtha amach cosúil leis an CV Europass. Nuair a bhíonn siad múchta, ní thairgtear na téamaí a thuilleadh, agus tarraingítear doiciméad a leagadh amach in aon cheann acu sa téama simplí go dtí go gcuirtear ar siúl arís iad."

